   "src": "5c3f4cc69311",
   "t": "{{hiroki}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1042,
   "src": "908cedd8cff7",
   "t": "...that's what she said."
  },
  {
   "i": 1057,
   "src": "3c0b13436a2f",
   "t": "Th-that sounds familiar."
  },
  {
   "i": 1062,
   "src": "5c3f4cc69311",
   "t": "{{hiroki}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1068,
   "src": "69f0e962bbea",
   "t": "So when I asked where"
  },
  {
   "i": 1071,
   "src": "df47f0e385e6",
   "t": "the strongest {{medabot}} is..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1079,
   "src": "5e7c73f9b40c",
   "t": "She told you it's here?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1091,
   "src": "5c3f4cc69311",
   "t": "{{hiroki}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1097,
   "src": "5ef32737b957",
   "t": "...Yeah."
  },
  {
   "i": 1112,
   "src": "41e9740fa347",
   "t": "I see, I get it now."
  },
  {
   "i": 1115,
   "src": "f0a43d978ea7",
   "t": "Well, I don't get it at all."
  },
  {
   "i": 1123,
   "src": "4225b4732d3a",
   "t": "But {{saika}}-san just transferred in, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1126,
   "src": "ccb4e5d96a02",
   "t": "How would she know about this place?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1131,
   "src": "5c3f4cc69311",
   "t": "{{hiroki}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1137,
   "src": "ee7769344082",
   "t": "Well... I don't know that."
  },
  {
   "i": 1145,
   "src": "6fc36eda927f",
   "t": "But from watching you fight, I realized"
  },
  {
   "i": 1148,
   "src": "76c075bc52b3",
   "t": "there's no way I could ever beat you."
  },
  {
   "i": 1156,
   "src": "cc0584a6ce59",
   "t": "..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1171,
   "src": "d348b9c561ac",
   "t": "I think I'll go home after all."
  },
  {
   "i": 1174,
   "src": "e11e1693b347",
   "t": "I'm going to forget about it completely."
  },
  {
   "i": 1182,
   "src": "9ba1423edf0d",
   "t": "See you!"
  }
